\u00e4ltetechnik) spielerisch entdecken und erste berufstypische Aufgaben ausprobieren. Ob Technik, Gesundheit oder Handwerk \u2013 finde heraus, was dir am meisten Spa\u00df macht! :)\n\nEarly Access: Sei unter den Ersten, die jobVRiety testen!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "3902217326706597", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_3902217330039930_1240378813803928232_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TayP2KhkrmMQ7kNvwFgSni8&_nc_oc=Ado6rP9vG2IEnnTfLVKYfOYID_caeIomsuc8-kYQjaF3PYIwHeLsMFhdf16mJZgIViE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSWOumM6Fq46v9LMhKkCiQ87-LdosTQiVsXhY1sk2mSmQ&oe=6B0DAC76"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_1080x360.png", "id": "3076099412552471", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825091_3076099415885804_5417180118801740963_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x0d0zVHShCcQ7kNvwGt_8Ci&_nc_oc=AdqQsoHDL0wSBCjYuUfFcC87xsSv7AEc3h4bdOKUpfjHCs9ZHPqhfoDNJdEMfuGX5VA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQoMttV-x2Fa7ZNrsWWCAItK-Y6ECESSWtEMcNu1savGA&oe=6B0DA876"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_1440x1440.png", "id": "2448391595528830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824609_2448391598862163_943533169723644988_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8eLBv08fOlkQ7kNvwEc-P4r&_nc_oc=AdqlvHLacnnENPo1a1UkWVZj-R6Zmgz-stdcj4ERCeRVP4-U2JMN3Jr3TYZK25nrXkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSTcnmAKrlmOlXIpli2Bn-wNrIv11sN8tXmgsD50g4yRQ&oe=6B0DACFE"}, {"file_name": "JobVR_LogoClaim_rgb.png", "id": "1748084809102207", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "u